    `o 38 r 9(a) it proves service of the notices mentioned in Rule 7 and advertisement of the notice mentioned in Rule 8` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 9(b) it verifies a list containing the names and addresses of the persons who sent in particulars of debts or claims, specifying the amount of each` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 9(c) it distinguishes in that list the debts or claims admitted by the company, disputed by the company or alleged by the company to be outside the scope of the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 9(d) it states which of the persons named in the list made under Rule 5, and which named in the list made under this Rule, have been paid or consent to the reduction` IS A BOOLEAN

