§§ `Rule 11 -- certifying list of qualifying creditors`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 38 r 11 Registrar's certificate` HAS
    `o 38 r 11 the list is certified and filed by the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(a) the certificate specifies the debts or claims (if any) disallowed by the Court` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(b)(i) the certificate distinguishes the debts or claims the full amount of which is admitted by the company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(b)(ii) the certificate distinguishes the debts or claims the full amount of which, though not admitted by the company, the company is willing to secure` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(b)(iii) the certificate distinguishes the debts or claims the amount of which has been fixed by adjudication of the Court under section 78H(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(b)(iv) the certificate distinguishes other debts or claims` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(c) the certificate specifies the total amount of the debts or claims which have been secured for the purposes of section 78I(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(d) the certificate shows which qualifying creditors consent to the reduction and the total amount of their debts or claims` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 38 r 11(e) the certificate specifies the persons who sought to prove their debts or claims under Rule 10 and states which of such debts or claims were allowed` IS A BOOLEAN

